[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0377","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0377.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0823","title":"SGI Performance Co-Pilot pmpost 符号链接权限提升漏洞","description":"SGI Performance Co-Pilot (PCP) 2.1.x/2.2 版本中的 pmpost 程序存在符号链接漏洞，本地攻击者可通过在 PCP 日志目录（PCP_LOG_DIR）中对 NOTICES 文件创建恶意符号链接，利用 pmpost 程序以特权写入任意文件，从而实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 PCP 2.2.1-3 之前版本，CVSS 评分 7.2（AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），攻击需要本地访问权限且无需认证，可导致机密性、完整性、可用性完全丧失。SGI 已在 PCP 2.2.1-3 版本中修复该漏洞，建议升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0823"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:01.520","remediation":"建议立即升级 SGI Performance Co-Pilot (PCP) 至 2.2.1-3 或更高版本修复 pmpost 符号链接漏洞。具体操作步骤：1. 从 SGI 官方补丁站点 ftp://patches.sgi.com/support/free/security/advisories/20010601-01-A 获取官方补丁包；2. 停止 PCP 相关服务（如 pcp、pmcd、pmlogger 等）；3. 解压并安装补丁包到系统中；4. 重启 PCP 服务使补丁生效；5. 验证 pmpost 程序不再存在符号链接攻击漏洞。若无法立即升级，可临时移除 pmpost 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/share/pcp/bin/pmpost）或限制 PCP_LOG_DIR 目录权限防止符号链接攻击作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-06/0245.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99290754901708&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2887","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6724","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20937","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2a4c15d247e2aa1e32bb9712f81631be3a25fb82/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0823.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0823","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad51007022161bcf4c63e713af3138cc91fa14f3/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0823.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0823.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1a41c9d6d7d672e9827f8c58d21e4c7f780013f8/2001/CVE-2001-0823.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0823.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0823.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0823.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e53ad9736e31e7f4c8c10d23df048f09c1bf7f31/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-08xx/CVE-2001-0823.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0823.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0377.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0375","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0375.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0821","title":"DC Scripts DCShop Beta 1.0 02 文件泄露漏洞","description":"DC Shop 1.002 beta 版本存在配置缺陷，默认情况下将敏感文件（包括 orders.txt 和 auth_user_file.txt）存储于 cgi-bin 目录中。攻击者无需身份验证即可通过 HTTP GET 请求直接访问这些文件。攻击者可利用此漏洞获取用户凭证、交易订单等敏感数据，威胁网站系统安全。该漏洞影响 Windows 及 Web 应用环境，CVSS 评分 6.92，危害等级较高。攻击者可借助简单网络请求实施信息泄露，破坏系统保密性。（≥50字）","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0821"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:01.253","remediation":"立即将 DCShop 敏感文件（orders.txt、auth_user_file.txt）移出 cgi-bin 目录至 Web 不可访问路径；在 Web 服务器配置中添加拒绝访问 *.txt 文件的规则（如 Apache 使用 <Files \"*.txt\"> Require all denied </Files>）；若官方仍有更新版本请升级至最新版，否则建议更换成熟电商系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-06/0233.html","http://www.dcscripts.com/dcforum/dcshop/44.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2889","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6707","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20939","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3290bfd28d98351fcc1665e3427425a500ba46e2/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0821.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0821","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0821.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad51007022161bcf4c63e713af3138cc91fa14f3/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0821.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9gff-q82g-327q/GHSA-9gff-q82g-327q.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0821.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2889/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0821.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0375.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0375.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0375.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0373","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0373.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0820","title":"GazTek ghttpd 1.4.x 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"GazTek ghttpd 1.4.x Web服务器存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞，存在于 util.c 中的 Log() 函数和 protocol.c 中的 serveconnection 函数中。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向这两个函数传递过长参数触发缓冲区溢出，进而执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 GazTek ghttpd 1.4.x 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（HIGH），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证，影响机密性、完整性和可用性。攻击者无需认证即可远程发送超长参数触发缓冲区溢出，实现远程代码执行。ExploitDB 和 GitHub 上均有公开 PoC 代码可供验证利用。建议升级到修复版本或停用该版本服务。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0820"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:01.117","remediation":"升级 ghttpd 到 1.4.1 及以上版本，该版本修复了 util.c 中 Log() 函数和 protocol.c 中 serveconnection 的缓冲区溢出问题，增强了输入参数长度验证。通过安装安全补丁并检查 httpd 配置文件中的参数限制，可防止攻击者通过长参数触发漏洞。如无法立即更新，建议通过防火墙限制对 ghttpd 端口的访问，并部署 WAF 以过滤恶意长参数请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99279182704674&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99406263214417&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2879","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2965","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6702","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21937","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2001/CVE-2001-0820.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3290bfd28d98351fcc1665e3427425a500ba46e2/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0820.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0820","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0820.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0820.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/64db5db4a6681c330f93cc62718610a5bc70bd7a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6fvf-gg5c-754m/GHSA-6fvf-gg5c-754m.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2879/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0373.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0369","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0369.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0818","title":"MDBms Query Display 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"CVE-2001-0818是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0818"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:00.807","remediation":"升级至 MDBMS 0.99b9 之后的修复版本，或在网络边界通过防火墙规则仅允许受信任的 IP 地址访问 MDBMS 控制台端口，同时禁用或限制 \\s 查询显示命令的远程调用。如无法升级，建议迁移至受支持的数据库管理系统并关闭不必要的远程管理接口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/190933","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2867","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6700","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20924","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/31dc8c450dfcd77f638f22bea49db9d32a878519/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0818.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0818","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0818.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73a8b58807bbd8e2a24b27e9365e9527f4708b8f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0818.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/7b6e012a8b6927ff0421192ff5550ae507d8e884/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jh4f-cp39-x2ff/GHSA-jh4f-cp39-x2ff.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0818.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2867/info.html","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0818.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_2.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0369.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0366","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0366.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0815","title":"ActiveState ActivePerl 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"ActiveState ActivePerl 5.6.1.629 及更早版本中的 PerlIS.dll 组件存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞。该组件在处理以 .pl 为扩展名的 HTTP 请求时，未正确校验文件名长度，攻击者可构造包含超长文件名的恶意请求触发溢出。漏洞影响在 IIS 等 Web 服务器上通过 PerlIS 运行 Perl 脚本的 ActivePerl 环境。攻击条件为网络可达且目标站点启用了 .pl 脚本映射，无需身份认证。成功利用可导致远程任意代码执行，CVSS 评分为 7.5，危害等级为高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0815"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:00.293","remediation":"升级到 ActivePerl 5.6.1 build 630 或更高版本以修复 perlIIS.dll 缓冲区溢出漏洞。在 IIS 管理器中，确保\"检查文件是否存在\"(Verify that file exists)选项处于启用状态作为临时缓解措施，该选项默认启用但被攻击者利用时需将其关闭。同时限制 IIS 对 .pl 扩展名的 ISAPI 处理权限，仅允许可信目录执行 Perl 脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugs.activestate.com/show_bug.cgi?id=18062","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100583978302585&w=2","http://www.osvdb.org/678","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3526","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7539","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21153","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2001/CVE-2001-0815.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cee83846410898acfe082d5ef5a9cde6a9d8b33c/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0815.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0815","https://github.com/CPAN-Security/cpan-advisory-database/blob/bc9ed2336eeed09f48acb0a64fd37970dc5a31d6/triage/CVE-2001-0815.yml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/26bf82f4a19fc2d731fb6ea3f027707d0e70bd44/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0815.json","https://github.com/briandfoy/cpan-security-advisory/blob/2089ff7201b44e5e462742a5baaa080ba003d257/util/cve-to-ghad","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0815.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3f1681edc3f70c2637ccb21590e6662de194aa5b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c5px-j32w-fcqp/GHSA-c5px-j32w-fcqp.json","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/perlIS_dll_bufferoverflow.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0366.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0366.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0365","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0365.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0805","title":"Tarantella Enterprise 3 任意文件查看漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Tarantella Enterprise 3.00/3.01 的 ttawebtop.cgi 存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过在 pg 参数中插入 \"..\"（点号）构造恶意请求，绕过目录访问限制，读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 Tarantella Enterprise 3.00 和 3.01 版本，攻击者利用此漏洞可获取系统配置文件、敏感数据等未授权信息。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0805"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:59.523","remediation":"如果使用的是 Tarantella Enterprise 3.00 或 3.01，应立即联系 Tarantella（原 SCO）获取安全补丁并升级到修复版本。如暂无法升级，应将 ttawebtop.cgi 从 /cgi-bin 目录中移除，或通过 Web 服务器配置（如 Apache 的 .htaccess 或 RewriteRule）禁止外部访问该脚本。同时可在防火墙或反向代理层拦截对 /ttawebtop.cgi 的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/20010619150935.A5226%40tarantella.com","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/3B2E37D0.81D9ED9D%40snosoft.com","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2890","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6723","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20940","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/443201f18f73f1db21c099e42f4e1967b96993dc/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0805.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0805","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c6db79ec54738aa67e7f26ae3b03fbb6f3301176/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0805.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9f14dd7a1c5691895422a824762c1dbc0caf1d9a/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0805.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a296135b4fb6684177b1ef84e538a96d91a93adb/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2qm4-5wpq-jgj4/GHSA-2qm4-5wpq-jgj4.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0805.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/sid-msg.map","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/T/ttawebtop.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0365.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0363","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0363.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0804","title":"Interactive Story 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Interactive Story 1.3 的 story.pl 脚本存在目录遍历漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 \"next\" 参数注入 \"..\" 路径遍历序列，突破 Web 根目录限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞利用条件简单，仅需网络可达即可，无需任何认证凭据，可能导致敏感配置文件、密码文件等敏感信息泄露，影响系统机密性。Interactive Story 1.3 所有安装版本均受此漏洞影响。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0804"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:59.393","remediation":"修改story.pl脚本，对next参数进行输入校验，过滤包含../序列的请求；在Web服务器层面限制CGI脚本对系统文件的访问权限；禁用或移除story.pl直至厂商发布修复版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/683","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/4.3.2.7.2.20010715184257.00b20100%40compumodel.com","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3028","http://www.valeriemates.com/story_download.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6843","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21008","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/98f5df8bf40c6af0934fb1e8baa83eb4ebb7d422/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0804.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0804","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c6db79ec54738aa67e7f26ae3b03fbb6f3301176/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0804.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b6371c93c0d252fc2d75ba4c6c31826fcf2f434e/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0804.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/story.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/b9f308eb006836885dfa59d3bfa81c3b8df73fb7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-24f9-34c8-68cp/GHSA-24f9-34c8-68cp.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0804.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0cb3007c-d398-4f31-a709-eb6e894cb439.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0363.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0362","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0362.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0803","title":"Sun Solaris CDE dtspcd 远程堆溢出漏洞","description":"Solaris 系统的 CDE 子进程控制服务（dtspcd）在客户端连接处理例程（libDtSvc.so.1）中存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-119），未经身份认证的远程攻击者仅需向目标系统的 TCP 6112 端口发送特制超长数据包即可触发该溢出，进而执行任意系统命令，完全接管受影响主机。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.5.1 至 9 等多个版本，CVSS v2 评分为满分 10.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C），危害等级极其严重。攻击者无需事先获取任何用户凭据或系统权限，只要网络可达即可完成利用，实现任意代码执行、敏感信息窃取及持久化后门植入，并可作为进一步内网横向移动的跳板。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0803"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:59.223","remediation":"Sun Microsystems 官方安全通告 #00214 已发布补丁：Solaris 8 请安装补丁 108949-07（SPARC）或 108950-07（x86），Solaris 7 请安装 106934-04（SPARC）或 106935-04（x86），Solaris 2.6 请安装 105669-11（SPARC）或 105670-10（x86），Solaris 2.5.1 请安装 108363-02（SPARC）或 108364-02（x86）。HP-UX 平台请按版本安装对应补丁：10.10 安装 PHSS_25785，10.20 安装 PHSS_25786，10.24 安装 PHSS_26029，11.00 安装 PHSS_25787，11.04 安装 PHSS_26030，11.11 安装 PHSS_25788。IBM AIX 4.3 请安装 APAR IY25436，AIX 5.1 请安装 APAR IY25437。Compaq Tru64 UNIX 各版本需安装对应 ERP 补丁包。如暂无法立即打补丁，可编辑 /etc/inetd.conf 注释掉 dtspcd 服务行以禁用 dtspcd，同时在防火墙层面阻断外部对 6112/tcp 端口的访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://ftp.support.compaq.com/patches/.new/html/SSRT-541.shtml","http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/214","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-31.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-01.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/172583","http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/3651","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3517","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise101.php","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7396","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A70","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A74","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/16323","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2001/CVE-2001-0803.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/793f2c91613b22189bf70b3322444954a50a3773/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0803.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0803","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/10de5f989525302a3452d86be5a85058aa88a086/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0803.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0803.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/40e5791b176b832cb09323d3962abe2fe3249e34/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-p2mw-q26f-vf87/GHSA-p2mw-q26f-vf87.json","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/xerror/parsing/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt","https://github.com/KvasirSecurity/Kvasir/blob/a5b3775184a8343240e1154a1f762f75df04dc0a/static/etc/canvas_exploits.xml","https://github.com/openctibr/threatFeeds/blob/569e64f21a36ad94da53d909e53f0d5114d5e7b7/ExploitableVulnerabilitiesFeed.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0362.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0360","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0360.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0800","title":"IRIX LPD 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"IRIX 6.5.13f 及更早版本的 LPD（Line Printer Daemon）服务中，lpsched 进程在处理打印任务时未对用户输入进行充分的命令过滤，允许远程攻击者通过构造包含 shell 元字符（如 ;、|、` 等）的恶意打印请求，在目标系统上执行任意操作系统命令。该漏洞影响所有运行 IRIX 6.5.13f 或更早版本的 SGI IRIX 服务器，无需身份认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级极高。攻击者可利用此漏洞完全控制系统，窃取敏感数据或 further 渗透内部网络。目前公开 ExploitDB 上已有编号 10033 的 PoC 可供验证，但官方修复方案需升级至 IRIX 6.5.14 或后续版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0800"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:58.940","remediation":"立即将 IRIX 操作系统升级至 6.5.24 或更高版本，该版本已修复 lpsched 中的 shell 元字符注入漏洞。如无法立即升级，可临时禁用 lpd 服务（停止 lpsched 进程并注释 /etc/inetd.conf 中的 lpd 条目），同时在主机防火墙层面限制来自外部网络的 TCP 6101/515 端口访问，仅允许受信任的管理网络段连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.lsd-pl.net/files/get?IRIX/irx_lpsched2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/27566","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/10033","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/700a72edb590fb1f0e5939ac4fed7cdb65918fb1/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0800.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0800","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/98c25b568de9f5663060bd4b7b00b621bdb6209c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0800.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/4d0f24b3edae0bdb5391177851bad3be54ecea0f/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/58ee4ff7906d19f4609c9ca9aa75dfba481e1462/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0800.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5e38d33f9418cdc3d68c36334a911de898286f5e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-98r6-v62g-7mmx/GHSA-98r6-v62g-7mmx.json","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/xerror/parsing/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0800.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0800.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0360.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0329","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0329.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0859","title":"Red Hat Red Hat Linux 7.1 Korean 安装程序 不安全默认 Umask 漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 7.1 韩语版安装程序内核版本 2.4.3-12 存在默认 umask 配置错误，初始化程序的默认权限掩码被错误设置为 000，导致安装过程中创建的所有文件拥有全局可写权限。未经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过网络访问安装程序，在安装过程中向系统写入或修改任意文件，导致系统文件被篡改、权限提升及完整性破坏。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 7.1 韩语版安装程序，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需身份验证，主要影响系统完整性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0859"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:06.990","remediation":"立即升级 Red Hat Linux 7.1 内核至 2.4.3-12 或更高版本，并应用官方安全更新 RHSA-2001-148；手动修改 Korean 安装程序中 init 的默认 umask 配置为 022，防止安装的文件被设置为全局可写；如无法立即升级，应禁止未授权用户在安装程序运行期间访问系统，安装完成后立即校验关键文件权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/3725","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-148.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3527","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7549","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0859.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0859","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/51d462e668438eaead0d5fabdd60f13269763472/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0859.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0859.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5p49-gvj5-jfx2/GHSA-5p49-gvj5-jfx2.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0859.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--f679f828-76ae-4a29-9ac7-4d7b8331e00c.json","https://github.com/x-s-g/Vuln-Intro/blob/aa42031a1aaff880d1d582777ef18a1a29cbebc3/Dataset/Dataset/getCVELink/statistics/no_versionStartIncluding.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0329.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0327","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0327.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0852","title":"红帽 TUX HTTP 服务器 Host 头拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Red Hat TUX HTTP Server 2.1.0-2 存在拒绝服务漏洞，由于 TUX HTTP 服务器未正确处理过长的 Host 头部字段，远程未授权攻击者可发送超长的 Host 头部 HTTP 请求，触发缓冲区溢出或资源耗尽导致服务拒绝。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 中 TUX 2.1.0-2 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证，仅影响可用性。攻击者只需发送包含超长 Host 头部的 HTTP 请求即可触发拒绝服务，Red Hat 已将其评级为重要级别并发布补丁修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0852"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:06.070","remediation":"升级到 Red Hat Linux 7.3 或更高版本，其中包含已修复的 TUX HTTP Server 2.1.0-2 Host 头超长拒绝服务漏洞补丁（具体补丁信息请查阅 Red Hat 官方安全更新）。或者，可禁用 TUX HTTP 服务并改用 Apache 或 Nginx 等支持 Host 头长度限制的 Web 服务器。若无法立即升级，建议在防火墙或负载均衡层添加 HTTP Host 头长度检查（限制在 256 字节以内），并配置 Web 应用防火墙规则阻止超长 Host 头请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100498100112191&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=tux-list&m=100584714702328&w=2","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-142.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3506","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7464","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21141","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0852.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0852","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0852.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7f7e3d84312983fcf49d3199fbaaf2fad83c05d2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0852.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x995-3jq6-p477/GHSA-x995-3jq6-p477.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2001-0852.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0852.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0327.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0325","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0325.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0851","title":"Linux 内核 syncookie 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 2.0、2.2 和 2.4 版本在启用 syncookies 功能时存在严重安全漏洞。syncookies 是 Linux 内核中用于保护 TCP 连接的保护机制，通过在连接建立时计算并验证 cookie 来防止 SYN 重放攻击。然而，该漏洞允许未经身份验证的远程攻击者通过暴力破解 cookie 值来欺骗 syncookies 验证机制，从而绕过防火墙规则。该漏洞在网络层面构成安全威胁，攻击者无需任何权限即可执行攻击，利用难度较低。攻击者通过不断尝试不同的 cookie 值，最终找到一个可以通过 syncookies 验证的伪造值，从而非法访问目标系统并获取其中存储的部分敏感信息。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 2.0、2.2 和 2.4 版本，在系统启用 syncookies 时尤为突出。企业和组织应及时更新内核版本或禁用 syncookies 功能，以防止此安全漏洞被利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0851"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:05.903","remediation":"建议升级到包含 syncookies 安全修复的内核版本：Linux 2.5.48 或更高版本（如 2.6.2+ stable 版本），关闭 syncookies 或升级到支持安全 syncookie 实现的内核。可以关闭 syncookies（编辑 /etc/sysctl.conf，设置 net.ipv4.tcp_syncookies=0 并重启），或使用补丁后的系统，同时更新所有系统服务和完整性检查工具，如内核审计日志_analyzer 等工具。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000432","http://www.caldera.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-038.0.txt","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-082.php3","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-1683.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_039_kernel2_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-142.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7461","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2001/CVE-2001-0851.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0851.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0851","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0851.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gfc3-m7qc-fc7m/GHSA-gfc3-m7qc-fc7m.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0851.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4d515335-ec97-4765-a0ad-ab83184ffa95.json","https://github.com/shamedgh/confine/blob/a75dad3ad336e6258a42cd1ce4af061eea68ed76/cve.files/cveToFile.json.type.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0325.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0324","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0324.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0843","title":"Squid 代理服务器 2.4 FTP 代理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Squid 代理服务器 2.4 及早期版本的 FTP 代理功能存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可发送仅包含 MKD 命令的 FTP PUT 请求，触发 Squid 进程崩溃导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Squid 2.4 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证、仅影响可用性。攻击者只需向开放 FTP 代理端口的 Squid 服务器发送特制的仅含 MKD 命令的 FTP PUT 请求即可触发崩溃，导致代理服务拒绝服务。Squid 官方已在后续版本中修复此漏洞，建议升级至 2.5 及以上版本或禁用 FTP 代理功能缓解风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0843"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:04.817","remediation":"立即升级到 Squid 4.0 或更高版本以获取完整修复。如无法立即更新，可配置 `ftp_put_cmd_only_toplevel=off` 禁用敏感FTP命令，或通过防火墙限制FTP端口访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/conectiva/2001-q3/0020.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100109679010256&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-077","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-088.php3","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_037_squid_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-113.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3354","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7157","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0843.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0843","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0843.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0843.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/squid_dos.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3jpq-2j9m-x6ww/GHSA-3jpq-2j9m-x6ww.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0843.md","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-077.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151800_151900.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0843.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0324.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0322","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0322.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0835","title":"Bradford Barrett Webalizer 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"Webalizer 2.01-06 版本（及可能的其他版本）存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，远程攻击者可通过两种方式注入任意 HTML 标签：一是通过 HTTP Referer 头中嵌入的搜索关键词，二是通过反向 DNS 查询返回的主机名。该漏洞源于 Webalizer 在生成统计报告时未对 Referer 头中的关键词和反向 DNS 解析的主机名进行充分的输入验证与输出编码，导致恶意脚本可在查看统计报告的用户浏览器中执行。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程发起攻击，仅需诱导受害者访问包含恶意 Referer 的页面或控制反向 DNS 记录。漏洞影响 Webalizer 2.01-06 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证、可导致机密性、完整性、可用性部分受损。攻击者可利用该漏洞窃取用户会话、篡改页面内容或发起进一步攻击。建议升级至修复版本或禁用 Referer 统计功能、对反向 DNS 结果进行严格过滤转义。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0835"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:03.593","remediation":"立即升级到 Webalizer 2.9.1 或更高版本，这解决了 CVE-2001-0835 中提到的 XSS 漏洞。通过移除原生执行功能的全新版本，攻击者无法再通过搜索关键字或反向 DNS 查询注入恶意 HTML 代码。如果无法立即更新，建议禁用 Webalizer 服务或通过 WAF 规则过滤包含反斜杠或尖括号的 HTTP 请求和主机名，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.suse.com/archives/suse-security-announce/2001-Nov/0001.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100394630702875&w=2","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-1677.html","http://www.mrunix.net/webalizer/news.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-140.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-141.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3473","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7350","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7351","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2001/CVE-2001-0835.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0835.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0835","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0835.json","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/78b39fa4e3b98a034b1531a03afd2915b8497828/2001/CVE-2001-0835.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/webalizer.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-49cp-mq89-xq82/GHSA-49cp-mq89-xq82.json","https://github.com/syselement/tcm-sec-notes/blob/80d35f1b8a0848f3db433d6755c799ac51a884a7/peh/3-eth-hack/enum.md","https://github.com/TrshPuppy/obsidian-notes/blob/14e4da3df9ea0ce1a906c4956e5a0e6c75d73c26/PNPT/PEH/scanning-enumeration/kioptrix.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0322.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0322.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0320","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0320.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0834","title":"htDig htsearch CGI 任意文件读取与拒绝服务漏洞","description":"ht://Dig 3.1.5 及更早版本中的 htsearch CGI 程序存在配置文件解析漏洞，该程序允许远程攻击者使用 -c 选项指定一个备用配置文件。攻击者可以通过向目标系统发送包含恶意配置文件的 HTTP 请求来触发该漏洞。攻击者可以利用这一漏洞通过指定大文件（如 /dev/zero）来消耗系统 CPU 资源，造成拒绝服务；或者通过上传一个包含目标文件路径的配置来读取目标系统中的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞无需身份验证即可通过网络远程利用，广泛影响基于 htdig 的搜索引擎系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0834"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-12-06T05:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:03.360","remediation":"建议升级 htdig 至 3.1.6 或更高版本（已修复 -c 参数配置文件注入漏洞）。若使用 Debian 系发行版，请升级至 Debian 安全公告 DSA-080 提供的修复版本（htdig 3.1.5-2.1 或更高）。若暂时无法升级，可通过 Web 服务器配置（如 Apache 的 LimitExcept 或 ModSecurity 规则）禁止 htsearch CGI 接受 -c 参数，或在 Web 应用防火墙层面拦截包含 -c 参数的请求，同时限制 CGI 程序的文件读取权限（如设置 open_basedir 或 chroot 限制）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000429","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100260195401753&w=2","http://sourceforge.net/tracker/index.php?func=detail&aid=458013&group_id=4593&atid=104593","http://www.calderasystems.com/support/security/advisories/CSSA-2001-035.0.txt","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-080","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-083.php3","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_035_htdig_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-139.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3410","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7262","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7263","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0834.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0834","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0834.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0834.json","https